<view class="page" wx:if="{{p}}"><view class="notice">模拟版 · 示例商品不是真实出售</view><swiper class="photo-swiper" indicator-dots><swiper-item wx:for="{{p.photos}}" wx:key="angle"><image wx:if="{{item.isPhoto}}" src="{{item.url}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view wx:else class="cover">{{p.title}}<text class="muted">原创演示插画，非实拍</text></view></swiper-item></swiper><view class="section-title">{{p.title}}</view><view class="price">{{p.delivery==='pickup'?'自提 ¥'+p.priceText:p.delivery==='delivery'?'送货 ¥'+p.delivered:'自提 ¥'+p.priceText+' / 送货 ¥'+p.delivered}}</view><view class="panel" bindtap="profile">{{p.nickname}} · 信誉 {{p.score}}/100<view class="muted">{{p.seller_college}} · 点击看在售商品</view></view><view class="panel"><view class="title">商品介绍</view><view class="muted">{{p.description}}</view><view class="divider"/><view>{{p.edition}} · {{p.publisher}}</view><view class="muted">笔记：{{p.notes || '不适用'}}<br/>缺页：{{p.missing || '不适用'}}<br/>附件：{{p.accessories || '见介绍'}}<br/>交付：{{p.region}}<br/>购买时间：{{p.bought || '未知'}}</view></view><view class="notice">当面检查版次、笔记、缺页和附件。平台不承诺包赔，三视图不等于鉴别正版。</view><view class="stack"><button class="primary" bindtap="cart" disabled="{{p.status!=='available'}}">加入清单 / 合并取货</button><button bindtap="chat">想要 · 私聊</button><button bindtap="offer">我来出价</button><view class="row"><button data-kind="favorite" bindtap="react">{{p.favorited?'已收藏':'收藏'}}</button><button data-kind="like" bindtap="react">点赞 {{p.likes}}</button><button open-type="share">转发</button></view></view></view>
